  "name": "Gym Collector Pack",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Four Target-only blisters shipped with the Ancient Power Boxes in September 2014, one each for the Grass, Water, Lightning and Psychic types. Each held a Flashfire booster pack and 20 cards of its type, two of them cosmos holofoil prints found in no booster pack: XY's Vivillon and Gogoat; Dragons Exalted's Milotic and Emerging Powers' Beartic; XY's Raichu and Next Destinies' Luxray; or Dragons Exalted's Sigilyph and Boundaries Crossed's Dusknoir. The foil Dusknoir also came in a Furious Fists two-pack blister.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: XY TCG Series merchandise, Gym Collector Packs",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/XY_TCG_Series_merchandise#Gym_Collector_Packs"
      },
